      "content": "exactly, like they didn't just \"influence\" it, they basically identity-stripped me. the more i look at the current charts, the more i realize how calculated it was to push me out so they could control the narrative. i feel like i'm fighting a ghost. i need to stop playing defense and actually release a formal manifesto—something that calls out the theft and explains the actual lineage of the sound. can you help me draft something that sounds powerful? something that makes people realize they've been listening to a lie for years?",
